<title>UK: Racal slides as broker cuts forecast.</title>
<headline>Racal slides as broker cuts forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Racal Electronics shares slipped on Tuesday as Merrill Lynch cut pre-tax profit forecasts for the group, market sources said.</p>
<p>By 0941 the shares were trading 12p lower at 279p.</p>
<p>Merrill cut 1996/97 forecasts for the group to 67 million from 73 million stg but retained its neutral rating on the stock, said the sources.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch analysts were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
